# VHS Recording Script for mcp-outlook
# Run: vhs docs/demo.tape -> outputs docs/demo.gif

Output docs/demo.gif

Set FontSize 15
Set Width 950
Set Height 480
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "TokyoNight"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set Framerate 30

Type "claude"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type '"Check my unread emails and draft a reply to Alex about tomorrow'\''s sync"'
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 2s

Sleep 4s
